  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Dựa vào hình vẽ minh họa, ta xét tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>tan</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>tan</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Xét tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>tan</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>tan</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>tan</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>tan</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m.<br>Chiều cao của tháp xấp xỉ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>12</mn></semantics></math> m.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/fa370cf4370abd44d75ede603109a7f2e1ee20fb63443c123dd391a01fcd66eb.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidde